📌 About the Project

The Scientific Calculator is a Java-based desktop application developed as part of my college coursework.

Built with Java Swing ("javax.swing"), this project provides a graphical interface for performing calculations through interactive buttons.

The main objective was to gain practical experience in Java GUI development, event handling, and connecting user interactions with application logic.

✨ Features

- 🖥️ Interactive graphical user interface
- 🔢 Button-based calculator input
- ➕ Arithmetic calculations
- 🧹 Clear button to reset input
- ⬅️ Back button to edit input
- ⚡ Event-driven interaction using Java
- 🎨 Simple and user-friendly interface


