⚙️ Getting Started

Prerequisites

Before running the project, make sure you have:

- Java Development Kit (JDK) installed
- Apache NetBeans IDE 22 installed

🚀 Run Locally

1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/priyanshi17112007/Scientific_calculator.git

2. Open the project

- Launch Apache NetBeans IDE 22.
- Go to File → Open Project.
- Select the downloaded project folder.

3. Run the application

- Open the project in NetBeans.
- Right-click the project and select Run.
- Alternatively, press "F6" to run the project.

